* An external named only by an equate (ALL_SIZE equ Ext_Size): no undefined symbol in the
* object, as the Microware assemblers write no reference for it.
* fixed: 9aa72b9 2026-10-10 r68togas, m68k-os9-r68: padding by dialect; unreferenced externals removed
* expect nosym: Ext_Size
* expect reloc: R_68K_32          used
 psect unref_extern,0,0,0,0,0
ALL_SIZE equ Ext_Size
 dc.l used
 ends
